<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 270.3 mln rand S.African bonds Tues.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 270.3 mln rand S.African bonds Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 270.295 million rand's worth of bonds on Tuesday after buying 344.25 million rand's worth on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
